WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.350
I grew up on Sandu Aldea Street.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.450
Very close by.

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.050
So in a way I swapped one
quiet, lovely neighbourhood

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:13.950
for another one just as quiet and lovely,

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.750
where I was lucky enough
to bring up my children

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.450
and be close to my parents.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.750
It's a quiet neighbourhood.

8
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.150
It's fairly clean,
compared with other areas.

9
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.550
The parks are better kept.

10
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.850
The streets are lovely.

11
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.850
People here have an eye for beauty.

12
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.050
As you can see, the gardens are
full of all kinds of flowers.

13
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.250
It's nice.

14
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.550
I really do enjoy walking
these little streets.

15
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.650
When I go for a walk… Herăstrău.

16
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:55.650
That's where we always used to go,

17
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.650
with friends, with my parents,

18
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.650
and later on with my little girl.

19
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:06.650
And there's another park
close to my heart: Cișmigiu.

20
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.650
I used to work around there,

21
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:16.650
and I'd go there with my colleagues.

22
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.250
To the Monte Carlo.

23
00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.250
I don't know if it's still there.

24
00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.250
The Monte Carlo restaurant, by the lake.

25
00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:29.250
I'd rather they didn't build
little blocks of flats,

26
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:36.250
or fill the place with
odd-looking buildings.

27
00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.250
These are old houses.

28
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.250
Houses with character.

29
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:42.250
The architecture is splendid.

